    "intro_narrative": "The rain beats heavily against the window of the abandoned warehouse, now serving as the hideout for the city's most elusive cyber-criminal, 'The Architect'. As a lead detective, you've finally tracked down his operational base. The room hums with the sound of active servers and cooling fans. Somewhere in this tangled web of forensic evidence and custom-built decryption hardware lies a secure Python script—the final piece of evidence needed to crack his financial network and bring him to justice. The safe containing it is heavily locked down. You must carefully examine the scattered clues, analyze the data devices, and follow the digital breadcrumbs he carelessly left behind. Time is running out before his automated protocols wipe everything.",
    "narrative_style": "detective"
